<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dragging, trailing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Ἕκτορος ἕλξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					391b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱματίων ἕλξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.122c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attraction, attractive power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				80c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλξει ἐκ γῆς ἀναδίδοται τὰ σπέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Gaur.</u>
					3.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>drawing</i> of the bow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῆς χειρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Bel.</u>
					75.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>retching</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				55
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
